: 2834, "tag_name": "重音テト", "cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/tag/c94c1b7d535b8f1d34366f70b9ea019d586b9acf.jpg", "head_cover": "", "content": "        名称：重音teto(重音テト或简称重音)\n　　注：“重”字是念chóng 因为重音テト的罗马音中kasane是“重复的声音”的意思\n　　旧名：重音teto·pettenson\n　　假名：かさねてと\n　　种类：网络虚拟偶像\n　　由来：在2008年4月1日诞生，原型是模仿CRYPTON（CRYPTON FUTURE MEDIA）公司的VOCALOID产品而诞生，已被该公司否认为亚种(派生人物)。但受初音未来的影响，在NICONICO动画网，算是比较有影响力的虚拟偶像。现在是UTAU（一种免费语音软件）的登场人物，而官设画像及声音资料所有权已集中归TWINDRILL 保护。传说中复活的歌姬。", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 1}, "day_count": 1}, "290": {"data": {"tag_id": 290, "tag_name": "VOCALOID", "cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/20825058199114b09729dc9bd526adcc360ea503.jpg", "head_cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2ff4ea96b2bcd7f28eded29d5a480a54c15473fe.jpg", "content": "VOCALOID是Yamaha所开发的电子音乐制作语音合成软件。输入音调和歌词，便可以合成为人类声音的歌声。", "short_content": "创造专属于你自己的虚拟偶像。", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "56": {"data": {"tag_id": 56, "tag_name": "初音ミク", "cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/tag/c35ba6ef84e82043e4c7ba769d0f90699ef960c1.png", "head_cover": "", "content": "初音ミク（初音未来）是Crypton于2007年8月31日以VOCALOID 2语音合成引擎为基础开发贩售的虚拟女性歌手软件角色主唱系列的第一作。“初音”是指“第一次的声音（初めての音）”、“出发点”、“最初的VOCALOID 2”；“ミク”汉字写作“未来”，指“VOCALOID所象征的将来音乐之可能性”。CV：藤田咲", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 1}, "day_count": 1}, "104464924": {"data": {"tag_id": 104464924, "tag_name": "えねみぃ", "cover": "", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 1, "state": 0, "ctime": 1790737872, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_att